{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02530","headline":"应诏咏巢乌 · 杨师道","name":"应诏咏巢乌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂树春晖满，巢乌刷羽仪。\n朝飞丽城上，夜宿碧林陲。\n背风藏密叶，向日逐疎枝。\n仰德还能哺，依仁遂可窥。\n惊鸣雕辇侧，王吉自相知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨师道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}